# Shark Bite — no player switch mid-FX

When a marked bank resolves Shark Bite, `bankAndPass` keeps `currentIndex` on the banker and sets `pendingTurnAfterSharkBite`. `clearSharkBiteFx` (SharkBiteScreenFX `onComplete`) advances the turn. Do not advance `currentIndex` while `sharkBiteFx` is true or pass-and-play handoff appears before the shark is on screen.

